WEBVTT

00:00:05.508 --> 00:00:06.551
(both screaming)

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:08.428
(both panting)

00:00:08.511 --> 00:00:09.429
-Hmm.
-Hmm.

00:00:09.512 --> 00:00:11.222
(straining)

00:00:16.602 --> 00:00:19.856
(grunting frantically)

00:00:26.821 --> 00:00:28.489
(gasps)

00:00:28.573 --> 00:00:31.909
(both grunting)

00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:35.538
(frustrated grunting)

00:00:35.621 --> 00:00:38.875
(bubble hissing)

00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:39.876
(gasps)

00:00:39.959 --> 00:00:41.961
(whimpering)

00:00:42.044 --> 00:00:44.338
(hissing continues)

00:00:44.422 --> 00:00:45.339
(whimpers)

00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:47.759
(squishing)

00:00:48.259 --> 00:00:50.303
(whooshing)

00:00:50.386 --> 00:00:51.304
(chittering excitedly)

00:00:51.387 --> 00:00:52.847
(sighs)

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.183
(screaming)

00:01:00.313 --> 00:01:03.065
(tinkling)

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:06.819
(dino babies chittering)

00:01:06.903 --> 00:01:08.946
SID:
I'm sorry, but you can't go in.
对不起 你们不能进去
曼尼说这是小朋友专用

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:10.907
Manny says it's just for kids.
对不起 你们不能进去
曼尼说这是小朋友专用

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:12.575
(groaning)
对不起 你们不能进去
曼尼说这是小朋友专用

00:01:12.658 --> 00:01:13.826
Wait a minute.
等等 你们是小朋友啊！

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:14.827
You are kids.
等等 你们是小朋友啊！

00:01:14.911 --> 00:01:16.078
(dino babies chittering)
等等 你们是小朋友啊！

00:01:17.163 --> 00:01:18.122
Ow.

00:01:18.206 --> 00:01:21.292
Just don't break anything.
不要破坏东西！

00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:23.836
The sloth says the playground's open.
树獭说游乐场开放了

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.379
(all cheering)
树獭说游乐场开放了

00:01:25.463 --> 00:01:27.882
No, wait, not for everyone.
不 等等！不是每个人都能玩

00:01:27.965 --> 00:01:29.342
(shrieks)

00:01:29.425 --> 00:01:31.969
(cheering continues)

00:01:32.845 --> 00:01:34.931
Oh, no, no, d-don't touch that.
不！别碰！

00:01:35.014 --> 00:01:37.099
(groans and grunts)
不！别碰！

00:01:37.183 --> 00:01:39.435
-Aah!
-(kids groan)

00:01:39.894 --> 00:01:41.229
Yahoo!

00:01:41.312 --> 00:01:42.772
What are they?
-他们是什么？
-谁在意啊？他们很好玩！

00:01:42.855 --> 00:01:44.398
Who cares? They're fun.
-他们是什么？
-谁在意啊？他们很好玩！

00:01:44.482 --> 00:01:45.358
Play nice.
-乖一点！
-妈咪 他不肯给我玩！

00:01:45.441 --> 00:01:47.276
GIRL:
Mommy, she's not sharing.
-乖一点！
-妈咪 他不肯给我玩！

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.237
-Aren't you going to do something?
-Why?
-你不管吗？
-为什么？我家小孩先来的

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.738
My kid had it first.
-你不管吗？
-为什么？我家小孩先来的

00:01:50.822 --> 00:01:51.781
-Did not.
-Did, too.
-才怪
-就是

00:01:51.864 --> 00:01:52.782
Did not.
-才怪
-就是

00:01:52.865 --> 00:01:54.450
-Did, too.
-Did not.
-才怪！
-骗子、骗子、毛毛着火

00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:56.244
Liar, liar, fur on fire.
-才怪！
-骗子、骗子、毛毛着火

00:01:56.327 --> 00:01:58.162
What is the matter with you?
你是怎么搞的？

00:01:58.246 --> 00:02:00.248
I'm a single mother with three kids.
我是要养三个孩子的单亲妈妈
同情同情我吧！

00:02:00.331 --> 00:02:02.083
I could use a little compassion.
我是要养三个孩子的单亲妈妈
同情同情我吧！

00:02:02.166 --> 00:02:03.167
BOY:
Whoa...
我是要养三个孩子的单亲妈妈
同情同情我吧！

00:02:03.251 --> 00:02:05.378
Slow down.
慢点！住手！

00:02:05.461 --> 00:02:06.963
(kids screaming)
别…

00:02:07.046 --> 00:02:08.297
Stop, stop, stop.
住手！

00:02:08.381 --> 00:02:09.799
(screaming)
住手！

00:02:10.383 --> 00:02:11.342
Ronald!
-朗诺德！
-太惨了

00:02:11.425 --> 00:02:12.885
Oh... that's a shame.
-朗诺德！
-太惨了

00:02:12.969 --> 00:02:14.262
(kids screaming)

00:02:14.345 --> 00:02:15.888
-Oh!
-Whoa!

00:02:15.972 --> 00:02:17.431
(squeaking)

00:02:17.515 --> 00:02:18.432
SID:
Stop.
停！

00:02:18.516 --> 00:02:20.101
Stop, stop, stop.
停！

00:02:20.184 --> 00:02:22.103
No, no, no!
不！

00:02:22.186 --> 00:02:24.188
(groaning)
不！

00:02:24.272 --> 00:02:25.648
Hold on, Little Johnny.
-撑住啊 小强尼！
-我在努力了！

00:02:25.731 --> 00:02:27.483
I'm trying.
-撑住啊 小强尼！
-我在努力了！

00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:29.402
(shrieking)

00:02:30.611 --> 00:02:31.654
(screams)
专家说得让孩子吃想吃的东西！

00:02:31.737 --> 00:02:34.740
You know, experts say you should
let your kids eat whatever they want.
专家说得让孩子吃想吃的东西！

00:02:35.908 --> 00:02:37.910
Do you think my ankles look fat?
你看我的脚踝很肿吗？

00:02:37.994 --> 00:02:39.954
Ankles? What ankles?
脚踝？什么脚踝？

00:02:40.037 --> 00:02:43.082
(echoing scream)

00:02:43.165 --> 00:02:44.083
(grunts)

00:02:44.166 --> 00:02:46.502
Ronald, where did you come from?
朗诺德！你从哪里过来的？

00:02:46.586 --> 00:02:48.087
(shuddering)

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:50.006
-(children screaming)
-MANNY: Oh, no.
哦 不

00:02:50.089 --> 00:02:51.883
Aah!
哦 不

00:02:51.966 --> 00:02:53.676
Okay, come on.
Spit him out.
快点 把他吐出来

00:02:53.759 --> 00:02:56.012
-Uh-uh.
-If you don't spit out Little Johnny,
不把小强尼吐出来

00:02:56.095 --> 00:02:58.472
we're leaving the playground this instant.
我们就马上离开游乐场！

00:02:58.556 --> 00:02:59.724
One...
一

00:03:00.224 --> 00:03:02.059
two...
二…

00:03:02.143 --> 00:03:04.478
Don't make me say "three."
别逼我喊三

00:03:04.562 --> 00:03:05.563
(squishing)

00:03:05.646 --> 00:03:07.189
Well, there we are,
好了 四肢健在

00:03:07.273 --> 00:03:08.691
a picture of health.
好了 四肢健在

00:03:08.774 --> 00:03:10.234
That's not Little Johnny.
-那不是小强尼
-有总比没有好

00:03:10.318 --> 00:03:11.402
Well, better than nothing.
-那不是小强尼
-有总比没有好

00:03:11.485 --> 00:03:12.528
DIATRYMA MOM:
Oh, Madison.
麦迪逊！

00:03:12.612 --> 00:03:14.155
-Aah!
-(Sid chuckles nervously)
麦迪逊！

00:03:14.238 --> 00:03:16.032
Come on. Barf him up.
-快点 把他吐出来
-希德？

00:03:16.115 --> 00:03:17.116
MANNY:
Sid.
-快点 把他吐出来
-希德？

00:03:17.199 --> 00:03:18.409
Oh, hey.
嗨 曼尼

00:03:18.492 --> 00:03:19.952
Hey, Manny.
嗨 曼尼

00:03:20.036 --> 00:03:21.329
(gasping):
Little Johnny.
小强尼！

00:03:21.412 --> 00:03:23.247
(groans)
小强尼！

00:03:23.331 --> 00:03:24.874
(cooing)

00:03:24.957 --> 00:03:27.209
-(tinkling)
-MANNY: Oh, wait. N-No.
等等！不…

00:03:27.293 --> 00:03:29.795
Oh, oh.
等等！不…

00:03:29.879 --> 00:03:32.048
Oh, I'm really sorry.
对不起

00:03:38.512 --> 00:03:40.056
This place is totaled.
-这里毁了
-不是我们毁的

00:03:40.139 --> 00:03:42.183
And we didn't wreck it.
-这里毁了
-不是我们毁的

00:03:42.266 --> 00:03:45.269
We're losing our touch, bro.
哥们 咱们的能力大不如前

00:03:45.353 --> 00:03:48.856
Well, the important thing
is that no one got hurt.
重点是没人受伤

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:50.316
Except for that guy...
除了那家伙

00:03:50.399 --> 00:03:51.734
and, and those three.
还有那三个

00:03:51.817 --> 00:03:52.944
GIRL: Ow.
还有那三个

00:03:53.027 --> 00:03:54.278
And her.
还有她

00:03:54.362 --> 00:03:56.447
(animals chittering)

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.449
I told you to take them back,
我叫你把他们送回去 你却留着！

00:03:58.532 --> 00:03:59.909
and you kept them.
我叫你把他们送回去 你却留着！

00:03:59.992 --> 00:04:01.160
Now, look what they've done.
看看他们干了什么好事！

00:04:01.243 --> 00:04:03.537
Okay, granted, we do have
some discipline issues.
没错 他们的确需要管教

00:04:03.621 --> 00:04:05.790
Eating kids is not a discipline issue.
吃小孩跟管教没关系

00:04:05.873 --> 00:04:07.208
But he spit them out.
-可是他吐出来了
-哦 太棒了

00:04:07.291 --> 00:04:10.169
Well, that's super.
Let's give him a gold star.
我们给他一颗星！
荣登本周乖小孩榜首！

00:04:10.252 --> 00:04:12.213
-Kid of the week.
-(laughing)
我们给他一颗星！
荣登本周乖小孩榜首！

00:04:12.296 --> 00:04:13.673
They don't belong here, Sid.
他们不属于这里

00:04:13.756 --> 00:04:15.967
Whatever they are,
wherever you found 'em,
不论他们是什么 从哪里来
送他们回去吧

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:17.677
take them back.
不论他们是什么 从哪里来
送他们回去吧

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:20.721
-Manny, I'm not getting rid of my kids.
-(dino babies yelping)
曼尼 我不要送走我的小孩！

00:04:20.805 --> 00:04:22.390
(loud rumbling)

00:04:22.473 --> 00:04:23.683
Earthquake!
地震啦！

00:04:23.766 --> 00:04:24.684
(grunts)
地震啦！

00:04:24.767 --> 00:04:25.935
(high-pitched grunt)

00:04:26.018 --> 00:04:27.645
Oh, it's okay. It's okay.
没事 妈妈在这里

00:04:27.728 --> 00:04:28.646
Mama's here.
没事 妈妈在这里

00:04:28.729 --> 00:04:31.148
(distant shrieking)

00:04:31.232 --> 00:04:33.150
Do earthquakes shriek?
地震会尖叫吗？

00:04:33.234 --> 00:04:37.279
(all gasping)

00:04:38.489 --> 00:04:40.324
(loud crashing)

00:04:40.408 --> 00:04:41.784
(low creaking)

00:04:42.368 --> 00:04:43.703
Aah!

00:04:44.996 --> 00:04:45.997
(screaming)

00:04:50.459 --> 00:04:52.461
(rumbling continues)

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.340
(roaring)

00:04:59.135 --> 00:05:00.386
(both scream)

00:05:00.469 --> 00:05:01.721
(both grunt)

00:05:01.804 --> 00:05:03.556
I thought those guys were extinct.
我以为他们绝种了！

00:05:03.639 --> 00:05:06.225
Well, then that is one angry fossil.
那这是块愤怒的化石 希德

00:05:06.308 --> 00:05:08.269
Sid!
那这是块愤怒的化石 希德

00:05:08.352 --> 00:05:09.520
Come on. Come on.
Come on. Come on.
快 进去！

00:05:09.603 --> 00:05:11.063
Inside, inside, inside.
快 进去！

00:05:13.858 --> 00:05:16.861
-Whoa-oh.
-(screaming)

00:05:18.029 --> 00:05:19.822
Oh, oh!

00:05:21.032 --> 00:05:22.616
Whoa!

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:25.161
(panting)

00:05:25.244 --> 00:05:27.663
(animals shuddering)

00:05:27.747 --> 00:05:30.791
Nobody move a muscle.
所有人都别动

00:05:34.462 --> 00:05:37.214
(snarls)

00:05:40.217 --> 00:05:42.094
(screaming)

00:05:43.179 --> 00:05:44.638
(roaring)

00:05:44.722 --> 00:05:45.806
(animals screaming)

00:05:51.353 --> 00:05:53.481
(growls)

00:05:53.564 --> 00:05:55.107
(screaming continues)

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:00.613
(dino babies crying)

00:06:00.696 --> 00:06:02.114
No, shh...
嘘 不要哭 别哭

00:06:02.198 --> 00:06:04.366
No, no, no, no, no.
Don't... d-d-don't cry. Don't cry.
嘘 不要哭 别哭

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:05.868
(wailing)
嘘 不要哭 别哭

00:06:07.578 --> 00:06:11.499
♪ We are poor little lambs
who have lost our way ♪
我们是可怜的迷途小羊

00:06:11.582 --> 00:06:13.667
♪ Baa, baa... ♪

00:06:13.751 --> 00:06:16.462
(screams)

00:06:17.797 --> 00:06:19.632
Aah!

00:06:20.549 --> 00:06:21.634
(Sid grunts)

00:06:21.717 --> 00:06:22.885
(growls)

00:06:22.968 --> 00:06:24.178
(panting)

00:06:24.261 --> 00:06:25.221
MANNY:
Sid!
希德 把他们交给她 她是妈妈！

00:06:25.304 --> 00:06:26.639
Give them to her!
希德 把他们交给她 她是妈妈！

00:06:26.722 --> 00:06:28.057
She's their mother!
希德 把他们交给她 她是妈妈！

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:30.101
How do I know she's their mother?
我怎么知道她是不是？

00:06:30.184 --> 00:06:32.061
What do you want--
a birth certificate?!
你想怎样 看出生证明吗？
她是只恐龙呀！

00:06:32.144 --> 00:06:33.604
She's a dinosaur!
你想怎样 看出生证明吗？
她是只恐龙呀！

00:06:33.687 --> 00:06:37.525
Well, I put in the blood, sweat,
and tears to raise them.
我含辛茹苦把他们拉扯大！

00:06:37.608 --> 00:06:38.818
For a day.
才一天！还人家 你这疯子

00:06:38.901 --> 00:06:40.486
Give 'em back, you lunatic.
才一天！还人家 你这疯子

00:06:40.569 --> 00:06:43.155
Look, these are my kids!
听着 他们是我的孩子

00:06:43.239 --> 00:06:45.241
-(murmurs)
-And you're going to have to go through me
想带走他们 你得先过我这关！

00:06:45.324 --> 00:06:47.159
to get them.
想带走他们 你得先过我这关！

00:06:47.243 --> 00:06:49.328
-(roaring)
-(screaming)

00:06:50.079 --> 00:06:51.664
(Sid screams)

00:06:52.873 --> 00:06:54.291
-Sid!
-Sid!
-希德！
-希德！

00:06:55.501 --> 00:06:56.627
Help!
救命啊！

